  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p>Can I Afford Japan? is run by a family, not a company. We're working on affiliate partnerships with booking platforms including Klook, GetYourGuide, and Expedia.</p>
  <p>Until those partnerships are finalized, any links to those sites on this blog are plain links — we don't earn anything from them. Once a partnership is live, links using it will be clearly marked as affiliate links in the post, and we may earn a small commission if you book through them, at no extra cost to you.</p>
  <p>We only ever link to places, tours, or hotels we'd genuinely recommend based on our own trips — the affiliate relationship never decides what we cover.</p>
</BaseLayout>
